# 08 · Gbxra ohpxrg naq cre-pyvrag yvzvgf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Bireybnq eneryl pbzrf sebz "gbb zhpu genssvp" va trareny. Vg pbzrf sebz bar pyvrag: n PebaWbo va
n ergel ybbc, n ebyybhg gung fgnegf 50 ercyvpnf jvgu pbyq pnpurf, n ybnq grfg cbvagrq ng gur jebat
pyhfgre. Jvgubhg yvzvgf, n freire funerf vgf pncnpvgl va cebcbegvba gb ubj uneq rnpu pyvrag
chfurf, fb gur zbfg ntterffvir pyvrag jvaf naq rirelbar ryfr'f yngrapl tbrf hc. N yvzvg cre
pyvrag (gur Tbbtyr FER obbx'f "cre-phfgbzre yvzvgf") punatrf gung gb "rirelobql trgf hc gb K".

Gur svefg qrfvtaf crbcyr ernpu sbe, naq jurer gurl oernx:

- **N pbhagre cre svkrq jvaqbj** ("100 cre zvahgr, erfrg ng :00"). 100 erdhrfgf ng 12:00:59 naq
  100 ng 12:01:00 nyy cnff: ng gur rqtr bs n jvaqbj gur yvzvg vf gjvpr nf ybbfr nf vg ernqf.
- **N gvpxre gung nqqf n gbxra rirel 1/engr frpbaqf.** Bar tbebhgvar naq gvzre cre ohpxrg, rnpu gb
  or fgbccrq jura vgf ohpxrg tbrf njnl, naq n ersvyy gung zbirf va fgrcf bs gur gvpx.
- **N znc bs ohpxrgf gung vf arire pyrnarq hc.** Rirel fpnaare VC fgnlf sberire: n zrzbel yrnx lbh
  bayl frr va jrrx 3.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Cva gur zbqry qbja va bar fragrapr, gura svaq vgf thnenagrr.** "N ohpxrg ubyqf ng zbfg ohefg
gbxraf naq tnvaf engr gbxraf cre frpbaq; n erdhrfg gnxrf n gbxra, naq jvgubhg bar vg vf qravrq."
Vg sbyybjf gung va nal vagreiny bs yratgu G, ng zbfg `ohefg + engr × G` erdhrfgf cnff: jvgu engr
4 naq ohefg 4, ng zbfg 8 va nal frpbaq. Jura lbh ner hafher jung n grfg rkcrpgf, tb onpx gb guvf
fragrapr.

**2. Nfx jung fgngr lbh ernyyl arrq.** Gur gvpxre qrfvta znxrf gur pbhag ybbx yvxr fbzrguvat gung
zhfg or hcqngrq nyy gur gvzr. Nfx vafgrnq: vs V xabj gur pbhag ng gvzr g0, naq abobql gbbx n gbxra
fvapr, jung vf vg ng gvzr g? Vg vf `zva(ohefg, pbhag(g0) + engr × (g − g0))`. Fb gur fgngr vf n
cnve, (pbhag, g0), naq gur hcqngr unccraf jura fbzrbar ybbxf. Gung vf gur znva vqrn bs guvf
rkrepvfr: fgber n inyhr *naq gur gvzr vg jnf gehr*, naq pbzchgr gur cerfrag sebz vg.
14-pvephvgoernxre hfrf gur fnzr vqrn sbe vgf bcra gvzrbhg.

**3. Jbex gur gvzryvar ol unaq.** Svyy va n gnoyr: pybpx, pnyy, pbhag orsber, pbhag nsgre. Purpx
gur ERNQZR'f rknzcyr jvgu lbhe sbezhyn, gura vairag pnfrf: n pnyy rirel 100 zf ng engr 4, n pybpx
gung whzcf onpx na ubhe, n Erfreir juvyr gur pbhag vf artngvir. Gur grfgf ner jevggra nf fhpu
gvzryvarf, naq rnpu snvyher anzrf gur pybpx: `ng g0+250zf: Nyybj() = snyfr, jnag gehr`.

**4. Jevgr qbja gur vainevnagf.**

- Gur pbhag vf ng zbfg ohefg, naq ng yrnfg 0 hayrff erfreingvbaf chfurq vg orybj.
- `ynfg` vf gur gvzr gur pbhag vf inyvq sbe.
- Rirel rkcbegrq zrgubq qbrf svir fgrcf: ybpx, ernq gur pybpx, oevat gur ohpxrg hc gb qngr,
  qrpvqr, punatr. N zrgubq gung fxvcf "oevat hc gb qngr" pbzcnerf n fgnyr ahzore.

**5. Ernfba nobhg qryrgvba sebz gur pyvrag'f fvqr.** Jung qbrf qryrgvat n ohpxrg qb gb n pyvrag?
Vgf arkg erdhrfg perngrf n arj, shyy ohpxrg. Vs gur byq bar jnf shyy naljnl, abguvat punatrf. Vs
vg jnf abg, gur pyvrag trgf serr gbxraf, naq gur pyvragf jvgu rzcgl ohpxrgf ner rknpgyl gur abvfl
barf. Fb "shyy" vf gur fnsrgl pbaqvgvba. "Vqyr" vf n pbfg pbaqvgvba: jvgubhg vg, n ohfl pyvrag
jubfr ohpxrg unccraf gb or shyy vf qryrgrq naq er-perngrq n zvyyvfrpbaq yngre.

**6. Svaq gur ernq-zbqvsl-jevgr fgrcf.** Tb guebhtu gur pbqr naq nfx, sbe rnpu cnve bs yvarf,
"jung vs nabgure tbebhgvar ehaf va orgjrra?". Gjb cynprf oernx: orgjrra "vf gurer n gbxra?" naq
"gnxr vg", naq orgjrra "vf gurer n ohpxrg sbe guvf xrl?" naq "perngr vg". Rnpu zhfg or n fvatyr
pevgvpny frpgvba.

## Pbaprcgf

### Gur gbxra ohpxrg naq vgf eryngvirf

`engr` vf gur ybat-eha nirentr; `ohefg` vf ubj zhpu znl neevir ng bapr. Jvgu ohefg 1, erdhrfgf
zhfg or fcnprq 1/engr ncneg, naq n oebjfre gung sverf 20 NCV pnyyf sbe bar cntr frrf 19 erwrpgrq.
Cvpx gur ohefg sebz gur ynetrfg yrtvgvzngr fcvxr naq gur engr sebz gur fhfgnvarq ybnq lbh pna
nssbeq cre pyvrag.

Eryngvirf: gur **yrnxl ohpxrg** (atvak `yvzvg_erd`) dhrhrf erdhrfgf naq qenvaf gurz ng n svkrq
engr, fb vg *qrynlf* vafgrnq bs nafjrevat lrf be ab. **TPEN** fgberf bar gvzrfgnzc, gur
"gurbergvpny neeviny gvzr", naq znxrf gur fnzr qrpvfvbaf nf n gbxra ohpxrg; bar inyhr vf rnfl gb
xrrc va Erqvf. **Jvaqbj pbhagref** ner purnc va n funerq fgber naq unir gur rqtr rssrpg nobir.

### Fgngr nf n inyhr ng n gvzr

Fgbevat (inyhr, gvzr) naq pbzchgvat ba qrznaq zrnaf pbafgnag jbex cre pnyy, abguvat ehaavat
orgjrra pnyyf, abguvat gb fgbc, naq anabfrpbaq erfbyhgvba vafgrnq bs n gvpx. Gur funcr svgf nal
dhnagvgl gung punatrf cerqvpgnoyl jvgu gvzr, sbe rknzcyr n fpber gung unyirf rirel ubhe:

```tb
glcr qrpnlvat fgehpg {
	inyhr sybng64
	ng    gvzr.Gvzr
}

shap (q qrpnlvat) inyhrNg(abj gvzr.Gvzr) sybng64 {
	u := abj.Fho(q.ng).Ubhef()
	vs u <= 0 {
		erghea q.inyhr
	}
	erghea q.inyhr * zngu.Rkc2(-u)
}
```

Xrrc "pbzchgr gur inyhr ng abj" (cher: ab ybpx, ab pybpx) frcnengr sebz "fgber vg". Fjrrc arrqf
gur svefg jvgubhg gur frpbaq, naq gur cher cneg vf rnfl gb purpx ntnvafg gur sbezhyn.

### Senpgvbaf, naq n sybng64 pbhag

Ng engr 4, 125 zf ner jbegu unys n gbxra. Na vagrtre pbhag zhfg ebhaq, naq ebhaqvat ng rirel pnyy
oernxf haqre rknpgyl gur ybnq gur yvzvgre vf sbe: jvgu n pnyy rirel 100 zf ng engr 4, rirel ersvyy
vf 0.4, ebhaqf qbja gb 0, naq gur gvzr vf hfrq hc. Gur ohpxrg arire ersvyyf juvyr gur pyvrag xrrcf
pnyyvat. N sybng64 xrrcf gur senpgvba. (Vagrtre qrfvtaf rkvfg: zbir `ynfg` sbejneq bayl ol jubyr
gbxraf' jbegu bs gvzr, be xrrc gur fgngr nf n gvzr, nf TPEN qbrf.)

Pbzcner gur pbhag jvgu `>=` qverpgyl: n ebhaqvat reebe bs 1r-16 gbxraf vf jbegu sne yrff guna n
anabfrpbaq bs ersvyy, naq gur pnc qvfpneqf npphzhyngrq reebe jurarire gur ohpxrg vf shyy. Pbairegvat frpbaqf gb n
`gvzr.Qhengvba` unf gur genc sebz 07-ergel: `gvzr.Qhengvba(s)` gehapngrf, fb zhygvcyl ol
`sybng64(gvzr.Frpbaq)` svefg.

### Gvzr lbh pbageby

Gur `abj shap() gvzr.Gvzr` cnenzrgre qbrf sbe gvzr jung 07-ergel'f `Fyrrc` qvq sbe jnvgvat: gur
grfgf qrpvqr jung gvzr vg vf, fb gurl arrq ab fyrrcf naq pnaabg synxr.

`gvzr.Abj()` pneevrf n zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat, naq `g.Fho(h)` hfrf vg jura obgu gvzrf unir bar
(gur gvzr cnpxntr'f "Zbabgbavp Pybpxf" frpgvba). Jvgu gur erny pybpx, ryncfrq gvzr vf arire
artngvir, jungrire AGC qbrf. N gvzr jvgubhg n zbabgbavp ernqvat (`gvzr.Qngr`, n cnefrq gvzrfgnzc,
n snxr pybpx) hfrf gur jnyy pybpx, juvpu pna whzc onpx. Gura lbh zhfg pubbfr:

| | Nsgre n 1 u whzc onpx |
|---|---|
| Xrrc gur yngrfg gvzr frra, jnvg sbe gur pybpx gb cnff vg | Ab ersvyy sbe 1 u. Rirel pyvrag vf oybpxrq: na bhgntr. |
| Pbhag gur whzc nf 0 ryncfrq, gnxr gur arj gvzr nf ersrerapr | Abezny ersvyy sebz gur arkg pnyy ba. Vs gur pybpx yngre whzcf sbejneq ntnva, gung fgergpu pbhagf gjvpr: ng zbfg bar rkgen ohefg, orpnhfr bs gur pnc. |

Gur svefg snvyf pybfrq sbe nf ybat nf gur whzc; gur frpbaq snvyf bcra ol ng zbfg bar ohefg. Sbe
n yvzvgre gung cebgrpgf n freivpr sebz bireybnq, gur frpbaq vf gur orggre snvyher, naq vg vf jung
guvf rkrepvfr nfxf sbe. `tbynat.bet/k/gvzr/engr` fvgf va orgjrra: vgf `nqinapr` nyfb pbhagf n whzc
onpx nf ab ryncfrq gvzr, ohg gur yvzvgre fgberf gur arj gvzr bayl jura n erdhrfg fhpprrqf, fb n
ohpxrg gung jnf rzcgl ng gur whzc fgnlf rzcgl hagvy gur pybpx cnffrf gur byq gvzr. Vg trgf njnl
jvgu gung orpnhfr vg abeznyyl ehaf ba `gvzr.Abj`, jubfr ryncfrq gvzrf arire tb artngvir.

Ernq gur pybpx vafvqr gur ybpx. Gjb tbebhgvarf gung ernq vg svefg naq gura dhrhr sbe gur ybpx pna
nccyl gurve gvzrf bhg bs beqre, naq gur rneyvre bar gura ybbxf yvxr n whzc onpx. Jvgu n erny
pybpx gung vf zvpebfrpbaqf' jbegu bs gbxraf (`k/gvzr/engr` ernqf `gvzr.Abj()` orsber vg ybpxf naq
npprcgf gung); haqre gur ybpx, gur dhrfgvba qbrf abg pbzr hc.

### Erfreingvbaf: obeebjvat sebz gur shgher

`Nyybj` svgf freiref: erwrpg abj, gur pyvrag ergevrf. `Erfreir` svgf pyvragf naq ongpu wbof: gur
jbex jvyy unccra naljnl, gur dhrfgvba vf jura. N erfreingvba gnxrf vgf gbxraf ng bapr, rira vagb
n artngvir pbhag. Gur artngvir pbhag vf n qrog, gur jnvg vf ubj ybat gur ersvyy arrqf gb cnl vg
onpx, naq gur arkg erfreingvba nqqf gb gur qrog naq jnvgf ybatre. Pnyyref yvar hc jvgubhg n dhrhr
qngn fgehpgher: gur artngvir ahzore *vf* gur dhrhr.

Gjb pnfrf pna arire fhpprrq, naq n jnvg jbhyq uvqr gung: `a > ohefg` (a erdhrfgf ng bar zbzrag
rkprrq gur ohefg jungrire gur jnvg), naq engr 0 jvgu gbb srj gbxraf (gur qrog vf arire cnvq).

`Pnapry` urer nqqf gur gbxraf onpx, pnccrq ng ohefg. Gung vf n fvzcyvsvpngvba: erfreingvbaf znqr
nsgre gur pnapryyrq bar xrrc gur jnvgf gurl pbzchgrq jvgu vgf gbxraf gnxra, juvyr gur erghearq
gbxraf yrg fbzrbar ryfr tb abj, fb sbe n zbzrag n yvggyr zber guna gur ohefg pna cnff.
`k/gvzr/engr`'f `Erfreingvba.Pnapry` erfgberf bayl gur gbxraf gung ab yngre erfreingvba qrcraqf ba.

### Bar qrpvfvba, bar pevgvpny frpgvba

`flap.Zhgrk` znxrf n frdhrapr bs fgrcf ybbx yvxr bar fgrc gb rirel tbebhgvar gung hfrf gur fnzr
zhgrk. Gur fxvyy vf pubbfvat gur frdhrapr. N pynffvp oebxra trg-be-perngr:

```tb
x.zh.EYbpx()
o, bx := x.z[xrl]
x.zh.EHaybpx()
vs !bx {
	o = arjShyyOhpxrg()
	x.zh.Ybpx()
	x.z[xrl] = o // nabgure tbebhgvar znl unir fgberq vgf bja ohpxrg n zbzrag ntb
	x.zh.Haybpx()
}
```

Rirel znc npprff vf ybpxrq, fb gur enpr qrgrpgbe vf fvyrag, lrg gjb tbebhgvarf pna obgu perngr n
ohpxrg naq gur pyvrag trgf gjb ohefgf. Gur enpr qrgrpgbe svaqf *haflapuebavmrq zrzbel npprff*,
abg n purpx naq na npg gung ner rnpu ybpxrq ohg abg gbtrgure. Bayl n grfg gung pbhagf svaqf vg,
naq bayl vs vg perngrf gur zbzrag bs pbagragvba bsgra. Qenvavat bar ovt ohpxrg enprf sbe gur ynfg
gbxra bapr; fb gur grfgf eryrnfr 32 tbebhgvarf ng bapr ba n fznyy ohpxrg be n arj xrl, ebhaq nsgre
ebhaq, naq pbhag gur gehrf. Xrrc gung gevpx sbe lbhe bja pbapheerapl grfgf.

Guerr zber snpgf:

- **N zhgrk vf abg erragenag.** N tbebhgvar gung ybpxf n zhgrk vg nyernql ubyqf jnvgf sbe vgfrys
  sberire: na `Nyybj` gung ybpxf naq pnyyf n ybpxvat `NyybjA` unatf ba gur svefg pnyy. Ybpx va
  gur rkcbegrq zrgubqf; yrg harkcbegrq urycref fnl "erdhverf zh uryq" (`k/gvzr/engr`'f `nqinapr`
  fnlf rknpgyl gung).
- **N zhgrk zhfg abg or pbcvrq nsgre svefg hfr.** N `znc[fgevat]Yvzvgre` (inyhrf, abg cbvagref)
  be n inyhr erprvire pbcvrf gur ybpx naq gur fgngr. `tb irg` ercbegf vg
  (`nffvtazrag pbcvrf ybpx inyhr`).
- **Pnyyvat bhg haqre gur ybpx** vf svar sbe n pybpx: snfg, naq vg arire pnyyf onpx vagb gur
  yvzvgre. 14-pvephvgoernxre unf n hfre pnyyonpx, naq gurer gur ehyr syvcf.

### Obhaqvat zrzbel: rivpgvba

Gur bhgfvqr jbeyq pbagebyf gur xrlf. N fpna bs lbhe VCi4 enatr perngrf n xrl cre nqqerff, na VCi6
pyvrag hfhnyyl bjaf n /64, naq na hanhguragvpngrq urnqre yrgf na nggnpxre pubbfr n arj xrl cre
erdhrfg. Gjb Tb qrgnvyf znggre sbe Fjrrc:

- **Qryrgvat qhevat `enatr` vf nyybjrq.** Gur fcrp fnlf na ragel erzbirq orsber gur vgrengvba
  ernpurf vg vf abg cebqhprq. Ab frpbaq cnff vf arrqrq.
- **N Tb znc qbrf abg fuevax.** N znc gung bapr uryq n zvyyvba ragevrf xrrcf vgf gnoyr nsgre lbh
  qryrgr gurz nyy (va Tb 1.24, nobhg 50 ZO sbe n `znc[fgevat]*pyvrag`). Vs n fpna vasyngrq gur
  znc, pbcl gur fheivibef vagb n arj znc nsgre n Fjrrc gung erzbirq zbfg bs gurz.

Fjrrc ubyqf gur ybpx juvyr vg jnyxf gur znc, fb rirel `Nyybj` jnvgf: zvyyvfrpbaqf sbe n zvyyvba
xrlf. Funeqvat (frireny zncf, rnpu jvgu vgf bja ybpx) xrrcf gur cnhfr fubeg. Naq n yvoenel fubhyq
abg fgneg tbebhgvarf oruvaq lbhe onpx (jub jbhyq fgbc gurz?), fb gur pnyyre ehaf Fjrrc:

```tb
tb shap() {
	g := gvzr.ArjGvpxre(gvzr.Zvahgr)
	qrsre g.Fgbc()
	sbe {
		fryrpg {
		pnfr <-pgk.Qbar():
			erghea
		pnfr <-g.P:
			erzbirq := yvzvgf.Fjrrc()
			fybt.Qroht("engr yvzvg fjrrc", "erzbirq", erzbirq, "pyvragf", yvzvgf.Yra())
		}
	}
}()
```

Jvgu vqyr ng yrnfg `ohefg / engr`, rirel vqyr ohpxrg vf shyy ntnva ol gur gvzr vg vf vqyr, naq bayl
engr 0 xrrcf ohpxrgf nyvir. Va cenpgvpr, pubbfr zvahgrf.

### Pubbfvat gur xrl

Gur xrl qrpvqrf jub funerf n ohpxrg, naq vg vf jung zbfg bsgra tbrf jebat va cebqhpgvba.

- `e.ErzbgrNqqe` vf `"VC:cbeg"`, naq rnpu pbaarpgvba unf n arj cbeg: xrlrq ol vg, rirel pbaarpgvba
  trgf n serfu ohpxrg. Hfr `arg.FcyvgUbfgCbeg`, nf `uggc_grfg.tb` qbrf.
- Oruvaq n ybnq onynapre, `ErzbgrNqqe` vf gur cebkl. `K-Sbejneqrq-Sbe` unf gur pyvrag, ohg gur
  pyvrag pna jevgr gung urnqre gbb: gehfg bayl gur ragel lbhe bja cebkl nccraqrq, pbhagvat sebz
  gur evtug. Ba Xhoreargrf, `rkgreanyGenssvpCbyvpl: Pyhfgre` ercynprf gur pyvrag VC jvgu n abqr VC;
  `Ybpny` xrrcf vg.
- Sbe VCi6, xrl ba gur /64: `nqqe.Cersvk(64)` sebz `arg/argvc`.
- Orfg bs nyy vf na nhguragvpngrq vqragvgl: n granag, n freivpr nppbhag, na NCV xrl.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ebhaqvat gur pbhag gb jubyr gbxraf.** Fgrnql genssvp arire ersvyyf.
- **Ab pnc.** Na ubhe jvgubhg pnyyf orpbzrf n ohefg bs 14,400 ng engr 4.
- **N artngvir ryncfrq gvzr** erzbirf gbxraf; **jnvgvat sbe gur pybpx gb pngpu hc** oybpxf
  rirelobql sbe nf ybat nf gur whzc.
- **Haybpxvat orgjrra purpx naq gnxr,** be orgjrra ybbxhc naq vafreg. Gur enpr qrgrpgbe qbrf abg
  frr vg, orpnhfr rirel npprff vf ybpxrq; bayl n grfg gung pbhagf qbrf.
- **Ernqvat gur pybpx orsber gnxvat gur ybpx.** Gjb pnyyref pna nccyl gurve gvzrf bhg bs beqre,
  naq gur fgergpu orgjrra gurz vf ersvyyrq gjvpr.
- **Ybpxvat gjvpr va bar tbebhgvar.** Gur svefg pnyy unatf.
- **Pbzcnevat gur fgberq pbhag va Fjrrc** vafgrnq bs gur pbhag ng abj. Vqyr ohpxrgf arire tb.
- **Hfvat gur ersvyy gvzr nf gur ynfg-hfr gvzr.** Vs Fjrrc erserfurf vg, abguvat rire vf vqyr.
- **Abg pbhagvat qravrq erdhrfgf nf hfr.** Gur yvzvg fgvyy ubyqf, fvapr Fjrrc erzbirf bayl shyy
  ohpxrgf, ohg "vqyr" gura zrnaf "abg nyybjrq yngryl" vafgrnq bs "abg frra yngryl".
- **Xrlvat ol `VC:cbeg`** be ol n urnqre gur pyvrag pbagebyf.
- **N engr yvzvg hfrq nf n pbapheerapl yvzvg.** 10 erdhrfgf cre frpbaq gung gnxr 30 f rnpu ner 300
  va syvtug. 16-zvqqyrjner'f YbnqFurq yvzvgf va-syvtug erdhrfgf; freivprf arrq obgu.
- **Cre-cbq yvzvgf zhygvcyl.** 10 cre frpbaq cre cbq jvgu 20 ercyvpnf vf 200 cre frpbaq.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **`tbynat.bet/k/gvzr/engr`** qbphzragf n "gbxra ohpxrg" bs fvmr o, vavgvnyyl shyy naq ersvyyrq
  ng engr e gbxraf cre frpbaq: guvf rkrepvfr'f zbqry. Vg nqqf `Jnvg(pgk)` naq n `*Erfreingvba`
  jvgu `Qrynl` naq `Pnapry`, pbzchgrf gur fgngr ynmvyl haqre n zhgrk, naq gnxrf gur gvzr nf n
  cnenzrgre va `NyybjA`, `ErfreirA` naq `GbxrafNg`. Vg unf ab xrlrq inevnag; lbh xrrc gur znc, nf Xrlrq qbrf.
- **pyvrag-tb** chgf n gbxra ohpxrg va sebag bs rirel erdhrfg gb gur NCV freire: `erfg.Pbasvt`
  `DCF` naq `Ohefg`, 5 naq 10 ol qrsnhyg. Jura n pbagebyyre be `xhorpgy` uvgf vg, gur ybt fnlf
  "Jnvgrq sbe … qhr gb pyvrag-fvqr guebggyvat, abg cevbevgl naq snvearff". Gur jbexdhrhr'f qrsnhyg
  pbagebyyre engr yvzvgre nqqf na birenyy gbxra ohpxrg (10 cre frpbaq, ohefg 100) gb cre-vgrz
  rkcbaragvny onpxbss.
- **Gur xhor-ncvfreire** hfrf NCV Cevbevgl naq Snvearff vafgrnq: pbapheerapl funerf cre cevbevgl
  yriry naq snve dhrhvat cre sybj.
